[comment encoding = UTF-8 /]
[**
 * The documentation of the module generate.
 * @author trangnguyen
 * @version 1.0.0
 * @since 1.0.0
 */]
[module generateMetamodelStats('http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/Ecore')/]

[comment @main/]
[template public generateMetamodelStats(aPackage : ecore::EPackage)]
[file ('metamodel_definition_stats.md', overwrite, 'UTF-8')]
  # Metamodel Definition Statistics: [aPackage.name/]

  ## Overview
  * **Package Name:** [aPackage.name/]
  * **Ns URI:** [aPackage.nsURI/]
  * **Total EClasses:** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EClass)->size()/]
  * **Total Enumerations:** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EEnum)->size()/]
  * **Total Data Types:** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EDataType)->size()/]

  ---

  ## 1. Class Breakdown

  | Class Name | Abstract | Interface | Attributes | References | Operations |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
[for (cls | aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EClass)->asOrderedSet()->sortedBy(c | c.name))]
  | **[cls.name/]** | [cls.abstract/] | [cls.interface/] | [cls.eAttributes->size()/] | [cls.eReferences->size()/] | [cls.eOperations->size()/] |
[/for]

  ---

  ## 2. Feature Totals across Metamodel

  * **Total Attributes (`EAttribute`):** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EAttribute)->size()/]
  * **Total Containment References:** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EReference)->select(r | r.containment)->size()/]
  * **Total Non-Containment References:** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EReference)->select(r | not r.containment)->size()/]
  * **Total Operations (`EOperation`):** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EOperation)->size()/]
  * **Total Parameters (`EParameter`):** [aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EParameter)->size()/]

  ---

  ## 3. Enumerations Detail

[for (enum | aPackage.eAllContents(ecore::EEnum)->asOrderedSet()->sortedBy(e | e.name))]
  ### Enum: [enum.name/]
  * **Literals ([enum.eLiterals->size()/]):** [enum.eLiterals.name->sep(', ')/]
[/for]

[/file]
[/template]
